# Latency vs throughput

Both axes quantitative, one mark per host, and a fitted trend to make the
relationship an assertion rather than an invitation to squint.

```mdv scatter
title: Latency vs throughput
x: rps
y: p99_ms
series: region
shape: region
trend: linear
format: table
---
region |  rps | p99_ms
apac   | 1240 |    182
apac   | 1610 |    204
emea   | 1980 |    221
emea   | 2440 |    268
amer   | 3120 |    301
amer   | 3780 |    366
```
